# local-inference builds its own image from its own directory (see
# local-inference/Dockerfile) and is never needed by web's or agent's build —
# excluded so neither image's build context (nor Docker layer cache) is
# affected by changes under it. agent/ is NOT excluded: agent/Dockerfile uses
# this same repo-root context (agent/src/worker.ts imports shared code
# straight from the main app's src/ — see that Dockerfile's top comment).
local-inference

